  "artifact_kind": "source-dependency-readiness-audit",
  "status": "CLOSED_TYPED_OBLIGATION_REFINEMENT",
  "synthesis": "Shortest source-compatible analytic path is genuine function-Gaussian LSI on the actual32 explicit square-root density, joined to actual canonical finiteKL33 once proved, plus independent genuine Gaussian T2. Exact pinned compact1D core has C2+compact-support hypotheses and three unported direct analytic parents; it cannot consume the positive noncompact literal32 f. Existing local product-update/Fubini leaves help genuine W12 extension/tensorization, but no Gaussian LSI/T2 producer was found in targeted pinned searches.",
  "source_contract": "source.scope.json",
  "API_inventory": "dependency-readiness.plan.json",
  "minimal_target": "minimal-producer.packet.json",
  "at_most_seven_steps": [
    "1. Establish the actual 1D variance1 C2 compact-support Gaussian function-LSI leaf using the pinned Bernoulli LSI and the two honest Gaussian entropy/gradient limit parents, porting only their minimal dependency spine. Preserve coefficient (1/2)*4=2; all currently unported analytic parents remain explicit.",
    "2. Prove the actual C1/W12 real extension with Gaussian cutoff/mollification/energy convergence and entropy lower-semicontinuity. Literal32 positive noncompact f cannot use the compact-only leaf; its actual C2 and L2 domains are internal inputs at the source consumer.",
    "3. Produce finite-product entropy subadditivity for nonnegative densities with mass and entropy L1; apply honest AE coordinate-slice W12/derivative identities and real LSI, then Fubini/sum to obtain Ent_pi(g²)<=2 integral sum_i partial_i(g)². Reuse existing Product endpoints; do not treat them as tensorization.",
    "4. Transport the actual product Gaussian through toLp2 and an orthonormal basis to arbitrary finite Hilbert E, including E0. Pull back actual f C2, its L2 and entropy domains, and identify partial-energy sum exactly with norm grad f². This gives a genuine function Gaussian LSI producer, avoiding canonical RN derivatives.",
    "5. At one coherent true source p/rho/R/r/Z/q/f, combine actual32 mass1 and energy=I/4 with independently proved finiteKL33 entropy equality (or the existing TiltedKL backend internally) to obtain genuine canonical KL.toReal<=I/2. Identify separately produced stationary witnesses only through the genuine uniqueness output.",
    "6. Independently produce Gaussian Talagrand T2 on the actual Euclidean ENNReal quadratic transport cost and canonical KL, with every chosen transport/Jacobian or LSI-to-T2 analytic dependency proved internally. Existing optimal-plan/Brenier/dual definitions are insufficient on their own.",
    "7. Use actual probabilities, finite KL/cost/moment adapters and the exact normalized constants to combine cost<=2 KL<=I and take the nonnegative square root for FIRST4.6. Bias means/coupling, the rest of4.6/fullLemma/main/work stay separate."
  ],
